OL,3,GNEWSAWarning to anglers after cygnet
OL,4,Ainjured by hook
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cygnet was found injured after a
OL,7,Ffishing hook got stuck in its foot,
OL,8,Fprompting a warning to anglers about
OL,9,Fthe dangers of discarded tackle
OL,11,FThe young swan suffered a wound after a
OL,12,Ffishing line became wrapped around its
OL,13,Fleg and a hook embedded in his foot at
OL,14,FButterley Reservoir in Ripley on 11
OL,15,FOctober.
OL,17,FA passer-by spotted the bird and raised
OL,18,Fthe alarm. RSPCA officer Lucy Kingsley
OL,19,Fattended to take the animal to a vet
OL,20,Ffor treatment.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
